  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Chef is busy preparing for the next lunchtime, so he has given you the following task.\n\nYou are given an array aaa consisting of nnn positive integers. The goodnessgoodnessgoodness of the array aaa is defined as the GCDGCDGCD of all the elements in the array.\nFormally, goodness=GCD(a1,a2,…,an)goodness = GCD(a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n)goodness=GCD(a1​,a2​,…,an​).\n\nYou can perform the following type of operation:\n\n\nSelect any two elements of the array aia_iai​ and aja_jaj​ (i≠ji \\ne ji=j and 1≤i,j≤n 1 \\leq i, j \\leq n1≤i,j≤n) and replace both aia_iai​ and aja_jaj​ with ai⋅aja_i\\cdot a_jai​⋅aj​.\nYou can perform this operation **at most once**. Find the **maximum goodness** of the array.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of the input contains a single integer TTT denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nThe first line of each test case contains a single integer nnn.\nThe second line contains nnn space-separated integers a1,a2,…,ana_1, a_2, \\dots, a_na1​,a2​,…,an​.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, print a single line containing a single integer representing the maximum goodness of the array.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤2001 \\leq T \\leq 2001≤T≤200",
      "2≤n≤2⋅1052 \\leq n \\leq 2\\cdot10^52≤n≤2⋅105",
      "1≤ai≤10181 \\leq a_i \\leq 10^{18}1≤ai​≤1018",
      "The sum of nnn over all test cases does not exceed 2⋅1052\\cdot10^52⋅105",
      "It is guaranteed that the maximum goodness will not exceed 101810^{18}1018",
      "Subtasks",
      "**Subtask #1 (10 points):**",
      "1≤T≤2001 \\leq T \\leq 2001≤T≤200",
      "2≤n≤20002 \\leq n \\leq 20002≤n≤2000",
      "1≤ai≤1091 \\leq a_i \\leq 10^{9}1≤ai​≤109",
      "The sum of nnn over all cases does not exceed 200020002000",
      "**Subtask #2 (50 points):**",
      "1≤T≤2001 \\leq T \\leq 2001≤T≤200",
      "2≤n≤1052 \\leq n \\leq 10^52≤n≤105",
      "1≤ai≤1091 \\leq a_i \\leq 10^{9}1≤ai​≤109",
      "The sum of nnn over all cases does not exceed 10510^5105",
      "**Subtask #3 (40 points):** Original Constraints"
